# ==================================

# Specific temporary files found in your project
NUL

# Claude Code files (keep CLAUDE.md but ignore temp files)
.claude/

# Keep important Odoo files
!requirements.txt
!requirements-dev.txt
!MANIFEST.in
!setup.py
!setup.cfg
!COPYRIGHT
!LICENSE
!README.md
!SECURITY.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md

# Ignore all addons by default
